ROOT.{definitions}.{configurePresetsArchitectureV10}.{anyOf}.1.{description}."An optional object representing the platform for generators that support it. Available in version 10 and higher."
ROOT.{definitions}.{configurePresetsArchitectureV10}.{anyOf}.1.{type}."object"
