ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{description}."An optional array of test preset objects. Used to specify arguments to ctest. Available in version 2 and higher."
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{configuration}.{description}."An optional string. Equivalent to passing --build-config on the command line."
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{configuration}.{type}."string"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{configurePreset}.{description}."An optional string specifying the name of a configure preset to associate with this test preset. If configurePreset is not specified, it must be inherited from the inherits preset (unless this preset is hidden). The build tree directory is inferred from the configure preset."
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{configurePreset}.{minLength}."1"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{configurePreset}.{type}."string"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{description}.{description}."An optional string with a human-friendly description of the preset."
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{description}.{type}."string"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{displayName}.{description}."An optional string with a human-friendly name of the preset."
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{displayName}.{type}."string"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{environment}.{additionalProperties}.{anyOf}.0.{description}."Setting a variable to null causes it to not be set, even if a value was inherited from another preset."
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{environment}.{additionalProperties}.{anyOf}.0.{type}."null"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{environment}.{additionalProperties}.{anyOf}.1.{description}."A string representing the value of the variable."
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{environment}.{additionalProperties}.{anyOf}.1.{type}."string"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{environment}.{description}."An optional map of environment variables. The key is the variable name (which must not be an empty string). Each variable is set regardless of whether or not a value was given to it by the process's environment. This field supports macro expansion, and environment variables in this map may reference each other, and may be listed in any order, as long as such references do not cause a cycle (for example,if ENV_1 is $env{ENV_2}, ENV_2 may not be $env{ENV_1}.) Environment variables are inherited through the inherits field, and the preset's environment will be the union of its own environment and the environment from all its parents. If multiple presets in this union define the same variable, the standard rules of inherits are applied. Setting a variable to null causes it to not be set, even if a value was inherited from another preset."
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{environment}.{propertyNames}.{pattern}."^.+$"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{environment}.{type}."object"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{execution}.{description}."An optional object specifying options for test execution."
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{execution}.{properties}.{enableFailover}.{description}."An optional boolean. If true, equivalent to passing -F on the command line."
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{execution}.{properties}.{enableFailover}.{type}."boolean"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{execution}.{properties}.{interactiveDebugging}.{description}."An optional boolean. If true, equivalent to passing --interactive-debug-mode 1 on the command line. If false, equivalent to passing --interactive-debug-mode 0 on the command line."
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{execution}.{properties}.{interactiveDebugging}.{type}."boolean"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{execution}.{properties}.{jobs}.{description}."An optional integer. Equivalent to passing --parallel on the command line."
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{execution}.{properties}.{jobs}.{type}."integer"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{execution}.{properties}.{noTestsAction}.{description}."An optional string specifying the behavior if no tests are found. Must be one of the following values: "default" (equivalent to not passing any value on the command line), "error" (equivalent to passing --no-tests=error on the command line), or "ignore" (equivalent to passing --no-tests-ignore on the command line)."
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{execution}.{properties}.{noTestsAction}.{enum}.0."default"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{execution}.{properties}.{noTestsAction}.{enum}.1."error"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{execution}.{properties}.{noTestsAction}.{enum}.2."ignore"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{execution}.{properties}.{noTestsAction}.{type}."string"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{execution}.{properties}.{repeat}.{description}."An optional object specifying how to repeat tests. Equivalent to passing --repeat on the command line."
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{execution}.{properties}.{repeat}.{properties}.{count}.{description}."A required integer."
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{execution}.{properties}.{repeat}.{properties}.{count}.{type}."integer"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{execution}.{properties}.{repeat}.{properties}.{mode}.{description}."A required string. Must be one of the following values: "until-fail", "until-pass", or "after-timeout"."
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{execution}.{properties}.{repeat}.{properties}.{mode}.{enum}.0."until-fail"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{execution}.{properties}.{repeat}.{properties}.{mode}.{enum}.1."until-pass"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{execution}.{properties}.{repeat}.{properties}.{mode}.{enum}.2."after-timeout"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{execution}.{properties}.{repeat}.{properties}.{mode}.{type}."string"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{execution}.{properties}.{repeat}.{type}."object"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{execution}.{properties}.{resourceSpecFile}.{description}."An optional string. Equivalent to passing --resource-spec-file on the command line."
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{execution}.{properties}.{resourceSpecFile}.{type}."string"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{execution}.{properties}.{scheduleRandom}.{description}."An optional boolean. If true, equivalent to passing --schedule-random on the command line."
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{execution}.{properties}.{scheduleRandom}.{type}."boolean"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{execution}.{properties}.{showOnly}.{description}."An optional string. Equivalent to passing --show-only on the command line. Value must be "human" or "json-v1"."
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{execution}.{properties}.{showOnly}.{enum}.0."human"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{execution}.{properties}.{showOnly}.{enum}.1."json-v1"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{execution}.{properties}.{showOnly}.{type}."string"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{execution}.{properties}.{stopOnFailure}.{description}."An optional boolean. If true, equivalent to passing --stop-on-failure on the command line."
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{execution}.{properties}.{stopOnFailure}.{type}."boolean"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{execution}.{properties}.{testLoad}.{description}."An optional integer. Equivalent to passing --test-load on the command line."
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{execution}.{properties}.{testLoad}.{type}."integer"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{execution}.{properties}.{timeout}.{description}."An optional integer. Equivalent to passing --timeout on the command line."
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{execution}.{properties}.{timeout}.{type}."integer"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{execution}.{type}."object"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{filter}.{description}."An optional object specifying how to filter the tests to run."
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{filter}.{properties}.{exclude}.{description}."An optional object specifying which tests to exclude."
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{filter}.{properties}.{exclude}.{properties}.{fixtures}.{description}."An optional object specifying which fixtures to exclude from adding tests."
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{filter}.{properties}.{exclude}.{properties}.{fixtures}.{properties}.{any}.{description}."An optional string specifying a regex for text fixtures to exclude from adding any tests. Equivalent to --fixture-exclude-any on the command line."
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{filter}.{properties}.{exclude}.{properties}.{fixtures}.{properties}.{any}.{type}."string"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{filter}.{properties}.{exclude}.{properties}.{fixtures}.{properties}.{cleanup}.{description}."An optional string specifying a regex for text fixtures to exclude from adding cleanup tests. Equivalent to --fixture-exclude-cleanup on the command line."
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{filter}.{properties}.{exclude}.{properties}.{fixtures}.{properties}.{cleanup}.{type}."string"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{filter}.{properties}.{exclude}.{properties}.{fixtures}.{properties}.{setup}.{description}."An optional string specifying a regex for text fixtures to exclude from adding setup tests. Equivalent to --fixture-exclude-setup on the command line."
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{filter}.{properties}.{exclude}.{properties}.{fixtures}.{properties}.{setup}.{type}."string"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{filter}.{properties}.{exclude}.{properties}.{fixtures}.{type}."object"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{filter}.{properties}.{exclude}.{properties}.{label}.{description}."An optional string specifying a regex for test labels. Equivalent to passing --label-exclude on the command line."
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{filter}.{properties}.{exclude}.{properties}.{label}.{type}."string"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{filter}.{properties}.{exclude}.{properties}.{name}.{description}."An optional string specifying a regex for test names. Equivalent to passing --exclude-regex on the command line."
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{filter}.{properties}.{exclude}.{properties}.{name}.{type}."string"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{filter}.{properties}.{exclude}.{type}."object"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{filter}.{properties}.{include}.{description}."An optional object specifying which tests to include."
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{filter}.{properties}.{include}.{properties}.{label}.{description}."An optional string specifying a regex for test labels. Equivalent to passing --label-regex on the command line."
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{filter}.{properties}.{include}.{properties}.{label}.{type}."string"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{filter}.{properties}.{include}.{properties}.{name}.{description}."An optional string specifying a regex for test names. Equivalent to passing --tests-regex on the command line."
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{filter}.{properties}.{include}.{properties}.{name}.{type}."string"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{filter}.{properties}.{include}.{properties}.{useUnion}.{description}."An optional boolean. Equivalent to passing --union on the command line."
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{filter}.{properties}.{include}.{properties}.{useUnion}.{type}."boolean"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{filter}.{properties}.{include}.{type}."object"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{filter}.{type}."object"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{hidden}.{description}."An optional boolean specifying whether or not a preset should be hidden. If a preset is hidden, it cannot be used in the --preset argument and does not have to have a valid configurePreset, even from inheritance. Hidden presets are intended to be used as a base for other presets to inherit via the inherits field."
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{hidden}.{type}."boolean"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{inheritConfigureEnvironment}.{description}."An optional boolean that defaults to true. If true, the environment variables from the associated configure preset are inherited after all inherited test preset environments, but before environment variables explicitly specified in this test preset."
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{inheritConfigureEnvironment}.{type}."boolean"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{inherits}.{anyOf}.0.{description}."An optional string representing the name of the test preset to inherit from."
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{inherits}.{anyOf}.0.{minLength}."1"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{inherits}.{anyOf}.0.{type}."string"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{inherits}.{anyOf}.1.{description}."An optional array of strings representing the names of test presets to inherit from. The preset will inherit all of the fields from the inherits presets by default (except name, hidden, inherits, description, and displayName), but can override them as desired. If multiple inherits presets provide conflicting values for the same field, the earlier preset in the inherits list will be preferred. Presets in CMakePresets.json must not inherit from presets in CMakeUserPresets.json."
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{inherits}.{anyOf}.1.{items}.{description}."An optional string representing the name of the preset to inherit from."
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{inherits}.{anyOf}.1.{items}.{minLength}."1"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{inherits}.{anyOf}.1.{items}.{type}."string"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{inherits}.{anyOf}.1.{type}."array"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{name}.{description}."A required string representing the machine-friendly name of the preset. This identifier is used in the --preset argument. There must not be two presets (configure, build, test, package, or workflow) in the union of CMakePresets.json and CMakeUserPresets.json in the same directory with the same name."
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{name}.{minLength}."1"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{name}.{type}."string"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{output}.{description}."An optional object specifying output options."
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{output}.{properties}.{debug}.{description}."An optional boolean. If true, equivalent to passing --debug on the command line."
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{output}.{properties}.{debug}.{type}."boolean"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{output}.{properties}.{labelSummary}.{description}."An optional boolean. If false, equivalent to passing --no-label-summary on the command line."
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{output}.{properties}.{labelSummary}.{type}."boolean"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{output}.{properties}.{maxFailedTestOutputSize}.{description}."An optional integer specifying the maximum output for failed tests in bytes. Equivalent to passing --test-output-size-failed on the command line."
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{output}.{properties}.{maxFailedTestOutputSize}.{type}."integer"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{output}.{properties}.{maxPassedTestOutputSize}.{description}."An optional integer specifying the maximum output for passed tests in bytes. Equivalent to passing --test-output-size-passed on the command line."
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{output}.{properties}.{maxPassedTestOutputSize}.{type}."integer"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{output}.{properties}.{maxTestNameWidth}.{description}."An optional integer specifying the maximum width of a test name to output. Equivalent to passing --max-width on the command line."
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{output}.{properties}.{maxTestNameWidth}.{type}."integer"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{output}.{properties}.{outputLogFile}.{description}."An optional string specifying a path to a log file. Equivalent to passing --output-log on the command line."
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{output}.{properties}.{outputLogFile}.{type}."string"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{output}.{properties}.{outputOnFailure}.{description}."An optional boolean. If true, equivalent to passing --output-on-failure on the command line."
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{output}.{properties}.{outputOnFailure}.{type}."boolean"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{output}.{properties}.{quiet}.{description}."An optional boolean. If true, equivalent to passing --quiet on the command line."
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{output}.{properties}.{quiet}.{type}."boolean"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{output}.{properties}.{shortProgress}.{description}."An optional boolean. If true, equivalent to passing --progress on the command line."
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{output}.{properties}.{shortProgress}.{type}."boolean"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{output}.{properties}.{subprojectSummary}.{description}."An optional boolean. If false, equivalent to passing --no-subproject-summary on the command line."
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{output}.{properties}.{subprojectSummary}.{type}."boolean"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{output}.{properties}.{verbosity}.{description}."An optional string specifying verbosity level. Valid values are "default" (equivalent to passing no verbosity flags on the command line), "verbose" (equivalent to passing --verbose on the command line), and "extra" (equivalent to passing --extra-verbose on the command line)."
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{output}.{properties}.{verbosity}.{enum}.0."default"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{output}.{properties}.{verbosity}.{enum}.1."verbose"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{output}.{properties}.{verbosity}.{enum}.2."extra"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{output}.{properties}.{verbosity}.{type}."string"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{output}.{type}."object"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{overwriteConfigurationFile}.{description}."An optional array of configuration options to overwrite options specified in the CTest configuration file. Equivalent to passing ``--overwrite`` for each value in the array."
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{overwriteConfigurationFile}.{items}.{description}."An option written as a key-value pair in the form "key=value"."
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{overwriteConfigurationFile}.{items}.{type}."string"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{overwriteConfigurationFile}.{type}."array"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{vendor}.{description}."An optional map containing vendor-specific information. CMake does not interpret the contents of this field except to verify that it is a map if it does exist. However, it should follow the same conventions as the root-level vendor field. If vendors use their own per-preset vendor field, they should implement inheritance in a sensible manner when appropriate."
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{properties}.{vendor}.{type}."object"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{items}.{type}."object"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV2}.{type}."array"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV3}.{description}."An optional array of test preset objects. Used to specify arguments to ctest. Available in version 3 and higher."
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV3}.{type}."array"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV5}.{description}."An optional array of test preset objects. Used to specify arguments to ctest. Available in version 5 and higher."
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV5}.{items}.{properties}.{output}.{description}."An optional object specifying output options."
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV5}.{items}.{properties}.{output}.{properties}.{testOutputTruncation}.{description}."An optional string specifying the test output truncation mode. Equivalent to passing --test-output-truncation on the command line. Must be one of the following values: "tail", "middle", or "head"."
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV5}.{items}.{properties}.{output}.{properties}.{testOutputTruncation}.{enum}.0."tail"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV5}.{items}.{properties}.{output}.{properties}.{testOutputTruncation}.{enum}.1."middle"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV5}.{items}.{properties}.{output}.{properties}.{testOutputTruncation}.{enum}.2."head"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV5}.{items}.{properties}.{output}.{properties}.{testOutputTruncation}.{type}."string"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV5}.{items}.{properties}.{output}.{type}."object"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV5}.{items}.{type}."object"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV5}.{type}."array"
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV6}.{description}."An optional array of test preset objects. Used to specify arguments to ctest. Available in version 6 and higher."
ROOT.{definitions}.{testPresetsItemsV6}.{items}.{properties}.{output}.{description}."An optional object specifying output options."
