ROOT.{definitions}.{vendor}.{description}."An optional map containing vendor-specific information. CMake does not interpret the contents of this field except to verify that it is a map if it does exist. However, the keys should be a vendor-specific domain name followed by a /-separated path. For example, the Example IDE 1.0 could use example.com/ExampleIDE/1.0. The value of each field can be anything desired by the vendor, though will typically be a map."
ROOT.{definitions}.{vendor}.{type}."object"
ROOT.{definitions}.{workflowPresetsItemsV10}.{description}."An optional array of workflow preset objects. Used to execute configure, build, test, and package presets in order. Available in version 10 and higher."
ROOT.{definitions}.{workflowPresetsItemsV10}.{items}.{properties}.{$comment}.{$ref}."#/definitions/$comment"
ROOT.{definitions}.{workflowPresetsItemsV10}.{items}.{properties}.{steps}.{items}.{properties}.{$comment}.{$ref}."#/definitions/$comment"
